Value Required DeviceID (\S+)
Value Role (\S+)
Value Kind (\S+)

Start
  ^Device ${DeviceID}
  ^Device ${DeviceID} role ${Role} -> Record
  ^Host ${DeviceID} type ${Kind} -> Record
  ^Enter detail -> Detail

Detail
  ^Attr: ${Kind}
  ^\S -> Start

# Null EOF state suppresses the implicit Next.Record at end of input,
# so any output difference cannot be blamed on end-of-file handling.
EOF
